  "note": "Tacit builds this one file from dapp/evm-pool-wallet.js with build/build-evm-pool-wallet.mjs; it carries Poseidon and snarkjs 0.7.6 (in its prove worker, which the read-only engine never starts). build.mjs refuses a vendor file whose hash is not the one above. The files under vendor/dapp/ are Tacit's chain wallet and what it imports, at the same commit, kept at their own relative paths so their imports resolve: the engine uses its key derivation and its note scan only, and calls nothing in it that spends."
